OL,3,AUK could see 10 days without rain after
OL,4,A'wettest week in two years'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK could see as many as 10
OL,7,Fconsecutive days without rain after an
OL,8,Funsettled end to October that featured
OL,9,Fback-to-back storms.
OL,11,FIt comes after the Environment Agency
OL,12,Fsaid England experienced its wettest
OL,13,Fweek in two years thanks to Storms
OL,14,FAusten and Boelo.
OL,16,FFollowing this recent unsettled
OL,17,Fweather, the return of high pressure
OL,18,Fwill bring a prolonged spell of largely
OL,19,Fdry and calm conditions, with very
OL,20,Flittle rain in sight.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
