OL,3,AUK could see 10 days without rain after
OL,4,A'wettest week in two years'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMist and fog will remain a persistent
OL,7,Ffeature, with some slow-clearing dense
OL,8,Fpatches expected during the mornings.
